(text "PWM5-8 only. PWM1-4 leave the board on the ESC pad row (J3, POWER 1) and appear nowhere on this sheet.\nThree 1x04 rows on 2.54 mm centres form the usual servo block: signal / 5 V / GND. No series resistors -\n3.3 V logic straight from the RP2354B, which is what servos and ESCs expect." (at 15 10 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid 283f3893-1755-53ea-ba70-c6ca851bda8b))
